      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Swap an outfit in a video with XMAX X2.1. Load Video is a clip of a woman walking down a street, and Load Image is a sequined jacket. The prompt replaces only her jacket with the one from the reference image and names what stays: her face, hair, pose and movement, the street and the camera. The source video gives the scene and the motion, and the reference image gives the appearance. A reference image can also be a character or an object, as in the character swap example.\n\nX2.1 prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/xmax-x2-1/prompt-guide\n\nCopy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Swap an outfit in a video with XMAX X2.1. Load Video is a clip of a woman walking down a street, and Load Image is a sequined jacket. The prompt replaces only her jacket with the one from the reference image and names what stays: her face, hair, pose and movement, the street and the camera. The source video gives the scene and the motion, and the reference image gives the appearance. A reference image can also be a character or an object, as in the character swap example.\n\nX2.1 prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/xmax-x2-1/prompt-guide\n\nCopy example_inputs/ into ComfyUI's input folder first, and set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
